{
  "_comment": "Pins the accepted side of RFC-MACP-0007 Section 4's value sets (every recommendation, the three non-critical severities, and ABSTAIN), that a BLOCK evaluation does not veto, and that abstentions sit outside the ratio denominator (RFC-MACP-0012 Section 4.1). Before this fixture the corpus only rejected non-canonical casings, and it never accepted an Evaluation or an ABSTAIN.",
